ocations: Trailer Park, Suburbs, Metropolis, and Arcane Express</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic co-op runs with randomized events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A social-deduction mode with secret goals and suspicious friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobbloon rewards, slot machine power-ups, and cosmetics</p></li></ul></p>", "short_description": "An online co-op game where you and your friends play greedy gobblins invading human houses to steal and gobble loot. Climb, stretch, and manage your stamina to survive chaotic heists and feed your Gobblin King.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Hungarian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651490/63ed88c05332f3ecc4997fd50726e8e7fe93963a/header.jpg?t=1787763752", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651490/cfca0b855f96603d399442174c4228f8e7b1f4e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787763752", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651490/cfca0b855f96603d399442174c4228f8e7b1f4e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787763752", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l